### UnderlayNavigationClasses

Use the `classes` prop to style internal slots without replacing the component structure or animation logic.

```ts
type UnderlayNavigationClasses = Partial<{
	root: string;
	underlay: string;
	panel: string;
	toggleButton: string;
	toggleLine: string;
	navList: string;
	navLink: string;
	activeLink: string;
	footer: string;
	footerGroup: string;
	footerTitle: string;
	footerLink: string;
	foreground: string;
	header: string;
	brand: string;
	content: string;
}>;
```
